<title>USA: IHOP April same-store sales rose 4.8 pct.</title>
<headline>IHOP April same-store sales rose 4.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>GLENDALE, Calif. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>IHOP Corp said on Thursday its same store sales for the fiscal month of April rose 4.8 percent compared to the same period last year.</p>
<p>IHOP develops, franchises and operates International House of Pancakes restaurants.</p>
<p>As of March 31, the company said it had 734 restaurants of which 534 were operated by franchisees, 62 by the company, and 138 by area licensees. IHOP restaurants were located in 36 U.S. states, Canada and Japan, it said.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
